{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026wbXHk4gTvm1793095630.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>萬洲國際首三季少賺一成三，生物公允價值調整前純利10.1億美元。</p><p></p><p>收入則微升不足百分之1，至206億美元。期內，肉製品收入佔107億美元，增長百分之4.7。豬肉收入則下跌百分之6.8，至約78億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:01.900885+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T10:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T06:18:17.530558+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:27.253921+00:00","content_hash":"6cdbc493a5bccfb253610d6314220a23c04fae7d738d93217b209c3c49a8dbd2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:01.900885+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}